OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over stolen bus and
OL,4,Adriver attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged after a single
OL,7,Fdecker bus was stolen and crashed into
OL,8,Fa row of parked cars in Shropshire.
OL,10,FAli Balhad is set to appear in court
OL,11,Fover aggravated vehicle taking, driving
OL,12,Fa motor vehicle dangerously, robbery,
OL,13,Fthefts from a store and three counts of
OL,14,Fcriminal damage.
OL,16,FThe 33-year-old is also charged with
OL,17,Fassault, attempted grievous bodily harm
OL,18,Fand threats to kill over the incident.
OL,20,FArmed officers were deployed to the
OL,21,Fscene in Court Street, Telford, at
OL,22,Faround 18.35 BST on Friday.
